### Test 1: Sign Up a new user
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "noura",
  "email": "noura99@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phone": "+966500000000"
}

###
### Test 2: Sign Up with the same email again (expects 409)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "noura",
  "email": "noura99@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###
### Test 3: Log In (returns access_token and refresh_token)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "noura99@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###
### Test 4: Log In with a wrong password (expects 401)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "noura99@gmail.com",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

###
### Test 5: Log Out
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/v1/auth/logout

###
### Test 6: Forgot Password
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/v1/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "noura99@gmail.com"
}

